## Change Checklist

When a slice touches architecture-relevant code:

1. Update this file if the layer model, hard dependency rules, or the "what exists in the tree" list changed.
2. Update or create the matching product spec under `docs/04-project/slices/01-product-specs/` for any user-visible behavior introduced.
3. Update or create the active plan under `docs/04-project/slices/02-exec-plans/features/active/`.
4. Update `CONSTRAINTS.md` only if a new project-wide structural rule was confirmed by the slice (not by inference).
